Count stored fallback decisions, grouped by home, sender kind and rule

Usage: mxr classify report [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>      [default: 1000]
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
